          <baseCommit>55eb1748d0829c624a082e2e84c74212589b9f4d</baseCommit>
          <output>Done. Updated `org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.TravelPostcard` with a freshly invented Lisbon postcard.

Changes to `blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/TravelPostcard.bml` (properties only):
- **title**: &quot;A Day Among the Seven Hills&quot;
- **destination**: Lisbon (unchanged)
- **opening**: one vivid sentence — a tiled bench above the Tagus, salt, coffee and grilled chestnuts
- **body**: three short paragraphs — the Elevador da Bica descent, a pastel de nata and the Feira da Ladra, sunset behind the 25 de Abril bridge with fado
- **language**: English
- **date**: `2026-09-05T20:58:17` (execution time)

Validation: the block validates clean, and full project `validate` reports 0 errors / 0 warnings (3 pre-existing style recommendations in unrelated `packages/` files). No other files touched.
</output>
          <completedAt>2026-09-05T20:59:15</completedAt>
          <resultMappings>
            <workflow:ResultMapping>
              <source>${ #strings.concat( #this.parameters.targetBlock, '.properties.title') }</source>
              <resultPath>/title</resultPath>
            </workflow:ResultMapping>
          </resultMappings>
          <task>
            <workflow:InstructionTask>
              <instructions>Create or update the block ${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }
as a short travel postcard in ${ #this.parameters.language }
about ${ #this.parameters.destination }.
For each execution invent a new postcard.
The block must have these properties:
- title (type:Text) — a short postcard title
- destination (type:Text) — ${ #this.parameters.destination }
- opening (type:Text) — one vivid opening sentence
- body (type:Text) — three short postcard paragraphs
- language (type:Text) — ${ #this.parameters.language }
- date (type:DateTime) — now
Write only under the playground package. Do not edit
ModelTransformation metadata or files under _meta/transform/.</instructions>
            </workflow:InstructionTask>
          </task>
          <changedFiles>
            <type:FilePathEntity value="blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/TravelPostcard.bml" />
          </changedFiles>
        </workflow:AgenticOperation>
