${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }
so it sounds like a handwritten postcard in
${ #this.parameters.language }.
Keep title, destination, body, language, and date.
Only rewrite opening. Do not edit files under
_meta/transform/.</instructions>
            </workflow:InstructionTask>
          </task>
